Subject: [PATCH 1968/3799] soh: rename D_8094C874 -> sUnusedIntroCsValue1

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: written during the intro cutscene (30, 435, and the message index) and never read anywhere in the overlay; the name records that check, not an intent
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c | 11 ++++++-----
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c
index e1f3c68c8..758903452 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Boss_Tw/z_boss_tw.c
